WEBVTT

00:00.720 --> 00:05.780
<i>How surprised would you 
have been if you learned</i>

00:06.590 --> 00:10.370
<i>that I fell in love with you at first sight?</i>

00:16.790 --> 00:18.000
Haven't seen you before.

00:18.860 --> 00:21.960
What's a woman doing out here 
first thing in the morning?

00:28.420 --> 00:30.140
Oh, that doesn't matter.

00:30.630 --> 00:31.850
Come over here.

00:45.320 --> 00:46.080
Say...

00:50.290 --> 00:52.260
Do you like flowers?

01:07.080 --> 01:09.650
You may have doubts before 
picking up a sword,

01:09.650 --> 01:12.000
but never once it is in your hand.

01:12.380 --> 01:16.010
I know you understood that 
far better than I did.

01:26.690 --> 01:28.850
Do you remember how we parted?

01:30.060 --> 01:31.920
When you departed for the Great Conquest,

01:31.920 --> 01:34.580
I tried to stop you, and you shook me off,

01:34.580 --> 01:37.510
leaving a scar on my 
shoulder that never healed.

01:37.510 --> 01:42.230
I have not forgotten a single 
word of what you said to me then.

01:44.510 --> 01:45.870
When I come back...

01:47.880 --> 01:51.620
I have come to fulfill that promise!

02:22.660 --> 02:23.740
Theresia!

02:24.210 --> 02:24.870
Dad!

02:34.770 --> 02:37.090
I-It's not over yet...

02:39.050 --> 02:41.810
Theresia! I...

02:43.720 --> 02:44.970
Theresia?

02:48.400 --> 02:50.930
W-Wait! Please, wait!

02:50.930 --> 02:52.640
Stop, Theresia!

02:52.640 --> 02:53.690
Do you think...

02:53.690 --> 02:57.630
Do you think I'll allow 
you to do such a thing?!

02:57.630 --> 02:59.360
You can't be serious...

02:59.920 --> 03:02.010
Y-You can't be my mother!

03:02.010 --> 03:05.350
Even if you are,
there's no way Dad could lose!

03:05.350 --> 03:07.660
Heinkel! You can't handle this!

03:07.660 --> 03:09.290
Flee at once!

03:16.960 --> 03:19.070
D-Don't...

03:19.070 --> 03:22.050
Please don't do this, M-Mom!

03:25.440 --> 03:26.810
Theresia!

03:26.810 --> 03:28.350
Fight <i>me</i>!

03:28.850 --> 03:31.760
Look... Look at me!

03:31.760 --> 03:34.230
Me! Look at <i>me</i>!

03:34.610 --> 03:36.650
Theresia!

03:36.650 --> 03:37.600
That's enough.

03:48.890 --> 03:51.160
Reinhard...

03:53.620 --> 03:56.240
Wh-What the hell is going on?!

03:56.240 --> 03:58.170
Why... What did I...

03:58.770 --> 04:00.960
What did I do wrong?!

04:08.220 --> 04:09.680
Reinhar—

04:08.840 --> 04:10.640
The dead do not move.

04:10.640 --> 04:12.640
The dead have no future.

04:12.930 --> 04:15.480
I will not allow such absurdity.

04:31.270 --> 04:33.240
S-Stop this!

04:34.370 --> 04:35.900
Please stop!

04:38.360 --> 04:40.340
Please don't kill her!

04:40.340 --> 04:43.250
That's... That's my...

04:43.250 --> 04:46.700
my Theresia!

04:48.490 --> 04:52.550
Grandmother died fifteen 
years ago by my hand.

04:59.610 --> 05:02.230
The one you see here is a mere fake.

05:13.850 --> 05:17.000
<i>The divine protection of the Sword Saint</i>

05:17.860 --> 05:20.300
<i>came to me when I was twelve years old.</i>

05:46.640 --> 05:48.150
<i>I've received it?</i>

06:04.920 --> 06:06.650
There's no doubt about it.

06:07.010 --> 06:09.340
You are the next Sword Saint.

06:16.890 --> 06:18.540
Pick up your sword,

06:20.720 --> 06:21.850
Theresia.

06:25.390 --> 06:30.090
My older brother worked 
so much harder than I did.

06:30.720 --> 06:35.340
Not a single day went by that 
he didn't train with his sword.

06:36.210 --> 06:41.880
I loved my brother for his 
dedication and effort.

06:43.770 --> 06:47.980
Pick up your sword, Theresia.

06:49.110 --> 06:53.340
I destroyed my brother's dream.

06:56.410 --> 06:58.830
My first campaign came two years later.

06:59.420 --> 07:03.280
It was the kingdom's greatest 
and most horrific civil war,

07:03.280 --> 07:05.410
the Demihuman War.

07:28.980 --> 07:31.320
Theresia, are you afraid?

07:35.820 --> 07:36.780
I understand.

07:37.330 --> 07:42.480
After all, you were the sort of sweet 
girl who wouldn't even harm a fly.

07:44.420 --> 07:47.680
When you defeated me two years ago,
I was so frustrated.

07:48.130 --> 07:51.620
But in the end, I still loved the sword.

07:52.090 --> 07:55.210
I was born into the Astrea family, 
I had my little brothers,

07:55.760 --> 07:57.840
and I had you for a little sister.

07:57.840 --> 07:59.150
I'm grateful for that.

08:01.210 --> 08:03.560
I'm grateful to the sword.

08:04.350 --> 08:06.140
Brother...

08:06.690 --> 08:10.790
If you're afraid and don't want to do this,

08:10.790 --> 08:12.650
I'll protect you.

08:14.420 --> 08:17.340
I'm your big brother, after all.

08:21.370 --> 08:25.580
There's no need for you to fight.

08:25.580 --> 08:29.070
I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

08:31.130 --> 08:33.200
<i>In that first campaign,</i>

08:33.200 --> 08:36.060
<i>I didn't wield my sword even once.</i>

08:36.730 --> 08:38.880
<i>I couldn't do it.</i>

08:39.390 --> 08:43.350
<i>I couldn't even take to the 
battlefield in the first place.</i>

08:46.180 --> 08:50.770
<i>My older brother led the 
advance in my stead...</i>

08:52.350 --> 08:53.410
<i>and he died.</i>

08:54.760 --> 08:59.740
<i>But even then, I was not permitted 
to step down as the Sword Saint.</i>

09:00.490 --> 09:04.890
<i>The Sword Saint is a pillar of moral 
support for the entire kingdom.</i>

09:05.500 --> 09:09.750
<i>The fact that I fled in the face 
of the enemy was concealed,</i>

09:09.750 --> 09:11.740
<i>and the war raged on.</i>

09:13.240 --> 09:14.180
<i>Carlan...</i>

09:14.650 --> 09:15.900
<i>Cajiress...</i>

09:15.900 --> 09:18.000
<i>All of my brothers...</i>

09:18.000 --> 09:20.860
<i>Even my uncle,
the previous Sword Saint before me...</i>

09:21.470 --> 09:24.390
<i>They all died on the battlefield.</i>

09:26.430 --> 09:29.120
Pick up your sword, Theresia.

09:30.020 --> 09:32.410
You are the next Sword Saint.

09:32.410 --> 09:33.020
No...

09:41.700 --> 09:44.030
Back then, you must have thought,

09:44.520 --> 09:47.240
"He's so full of openings."

09:51.350 --> 09:55.830
Pick up your sword, Theresia.

10:05.430 --> 10:08.160
Pick up your sword, Theresia.

10:05.900 --> 10:08.160
"Pick up your sword, Theresia."

10:09.500 --> 10:11.050
I am the sword's...

10:11.880 --> 10:14.780
I must pick up my sword.

10:21.650 --> 10:25.110
What's a woman doing out here 
first thing in the morning?

10:32.040 --> 10:33.660
I win.

10:34.000 --> 10:37.810
You're weaker than me. There's no reason 
for you to wield a sword anymore.

10:38.300 --> 10:41.660
If I don't wield it, who will?

10:42.400 --> 10:46.930
I will inherit your reason 
for wielding a sword.

10:47.810 --> 10:48.940
And you...

10:50.430 --> 10:52.810
need only become <i>my</i> reason 
for wielding a sword.

10:57.450 --> 10:58.240
Say...

10:58.910 --> 11:00.330
Do you like flowers?

11:01.140 --> 11:02.730
I don't hate them anymore.

11:03.250 --> 11:05.650
Why do you wield a sword?

11:10.730 --> 11:14.400
To protect you.

11:17.600 --> 11:19.790
Do you love me?

11:21.410 --> 11:22.250
You should know.

11:23.940 --> 11:26.300
There are some things
I want to hear said aloud.

11:28.610 --> 11:29.390
Someday...

11:30.990 --> 11:33.010
When I feel up to it.

11:34.540 --> 11:39.740
<i>In the end, he never gave me 
an answer to that question.</i>

11:44.480 --> 11:48.360
<i>But from then on, we were so happy.</i>

11:48.360 --> 11:49.680
<i>So happy...</i>

11:50.780 --> 11:53.200
<i>We went through many things,</i>

11:53.200 --> 11:57.290
<i>but there was no doubt that we were happy.</i>

11:57.790 --> 11:59.340
I'm against this!

11:59.930 --> 12:01.420
What are you thinking?!

12:02.230 --> 12:03.880
I've made up my mind.

12:03.880 --> 12:05.850
Is it Heinkel?!

12:05.850 --> 12:08.690
That idiot, putting senseless 
ideas in your head!

12:08.690 --> 12:12.180
Neither you nor I have the right to say that.

12:12.730 --> 12:16.250
It's a hunt for the White Whale,
which suddenly appeared.

12:16.250 --> 12:19.790
But now that the princess has been abducted,

12:19.790 --> 12:21.480
the leader of the Imperial Knights—

12:22.170 --> 12:25.300
the Sword Demon—has no choice but to act.

12:25.300 --> 12:27.860
So as the Sword Saint, I must act.

12:29.360 --> 12:32.460
What he said makes sense.

12:32.940 --> 12:35.980
The title of Sword Saint 
is merely ornamental!

12:36.500 --> 12:39.500
Indeed. Thanks to you.

12:41.280 --> 12:45.090
Wilhelm, do you love me?

12:45.090 --> 12:45.710
Wha—

12:54.440 --> 12:55.510
Theresia...

13:02.560 --> 13:04.150
The divine protection of the Death God...

13:04.770 --> 13:07.780
Now you cannot follow me.

13:07.780 --> 13:11.010
If you do, your wound will never heal.

13:11.580 --> 13:15.050
I will follow you even if the 
blood never stops flowing.

13:15.050 --> 13:18.040
But then there would be no point.

13:18.620 --> 13:19.660
I'll be fine.

13:20.250 --> 13:22.640
Just who do you think I am?

13:22.640 --> 13:25.500
I'm the second strongest 
swordmaster after you.

13:26.160 --> 13:28.730
Even if that's merely ornamental.

13:28.730 --> 13:32.180
You're nearly fifty! Do you think 
you can compete with young—

13:32.950 --> 13:35.510
You don't need to say any more.

13:39.300 --> 13:41.730
I love you, Wilhelm.

13:43.780 --> 13:46.110
Yes, that's fine.

13:46.560 --> 13:49.180
You can answer me next time.

13:49.180 --> 13:50.110
Next time?

13:50.790 --> 13:52.250
When I come back...

13:53.170 --> 13:57.500
Let me hear the words you 
wouldn't say back then.

14:32.300 --> 14:34.300
Follow me!

14:48.420 --> 14:50.500
R-Retreat!

15:17.630 --> 15:19.360
The divine protection of the Sword Saint...

15:20.700 --> 15:22.390
Reinhard...

15:22.390 --> 15:25.900
What's this? A lone woman 
all the way out here?

15:26.580 --> 15:28.580
How very brave you must be.

15:31.820 --> 15:33.960
I see you dislike me now.

15:37.080 --> 15:39.440
<i>You don't need to be tied down.</i>

15:39.440 --> 15:44.560
<i>I pray you will have new encounters in 
your life with more than just the sword,</i>

15:45.390 --> 15:46.560
<i>as I did.</i>

15:50.120 --> 15:51.480
I want...

15:53.760 --> 15:56.190
to understand you.

15:59.430 --> 16:00.800
Wilhelm...

16:12.930 --> 16:15.510
You look... miserable...

16:16.000 --> 16:18.950
Theresia... I...

16:19.540 --> 16:21.970
Tell me, Wilhelm...

16:26.400 --> 16:31.820
There is something that I must... tell you.

16:34.930 --> 16:37.010
I am not good with words,

16:37.010 --> 16:42.130
and my failure to convey to you what 
I was thinking has made you suffer.

16:44.300 --> 16:45.260
So...

16:46.590 --> 16:50.310
For over twenty years, I never told you...

16:53.600 --> 16:57.580
I may have made you worry 
for the past twenty years...

16:58.290 --> 17:00.990
But I...

17:04.160 --> 17:05.820
Silly.

17:07.000 --> 17:10.310
You really never realized it?

17:11.020 --> 17:14.910
You've been saying it all this time.

17:18.460 --> 17:20.170
Your eyes,

17:20.910 --> 17:22.750
your voice,

17:23.240 --> 17:25.200
your bearing,

17:25.840 --> 17:29.080
your actions... all this time.

17:33.040 --> 17:35.880
Theresia, I...

17:36.790 --> 17:40.390
And... I...

17:40.390 --> 17:41.710
...love you.

17:52.910 --> 17:57.930
<i>I know my life was blessed 
from beginning to end.</i>

17:58.990 --> 18:02.020
<i>I had so many people helping me,</i>

18:02.020 --> 18:03.320
<i>and I met you.</i>

18:04.710 --> 18:07.950
<i>I have faith that you'll all be just fine.</i>

18:08.840 --> 18:12.330
<i>And I'll always, always love you.</i>

18:14.460 --> 18:19.610
<i>In the end, there was just one 
thing I regretted never asking you.</i>

18:21.170 --> 18:26.010
<i>How surprised would you 
have been if you learned</i>

18:26.010 --> 18:31.020
<b>Theresia van Astrea</b>

18:26.750 --> 18:30.300
<i>that I fell in love with you at first sight?</i>

20:05.080 --> 20:06.940
Are you satisfied now?

20:07.840 --> 20:09.050
Satisfied?

20:09.050 --> 20:11.910
Don't play dumb! It's exactly as I just saw!

20:11.910 --> 20:16.250
Now the position of Sword Saint is 
yours in both name and substance!

20:16.250 --> 20:18.000
Congratulations!

20:18.000 --> 20:22.380
Now there's no denying the rumor that 
you let the previous Sword Saint die

20:22.380 --> 20:24.220
and stole her divine protection!

20:24.220 --> 20:25.880
So now you're satisfied, right?

20:26.270 --> 20:28.150
You're satisfied, aren't you?!

20:29.000 --> 20:32.850
I'm afraid I don't understand 
what you're saying.

20:34.240 --> 20:37.680
Don't give me that pretentious look,
you rotten brat!

20:39.670 --> 20:41.780
Don't go getting cocky!

20:41.780 --> 20:45.830
No matter what you say,
it doesn't change what I saw!

20:45.830 --> 20:51.130
It's true that you cut down my mother,
Theresia van Astrea!

20:51.130 --> 20:52.380
I'll tell everyone!

20:52.380 --> 20:53.890
I'll let the whole world know

20:53.890 --> 20:58.010
and make sure no one accepts 
you as the Sword Saint!

20:59.280 --> 21:04.390
I'm sure you'll say whatever you 
have to say to hold on to the title,

21:04.390 --> 21:07.580
but a Sword Saint who killed 
his own flesh and blood?

21:07.580 --> 21:09.500
The sword of the kingdom?!

21:10.100 --> 21:13.220
Don't make me laugh, you murderer!

21:13.770 --> 21:18.000
Vice Captain, no matter how many times 
you say all this, I don't understand.

21:18.000 --> 21:18.930
You are mistaken.

21:21.130 --> 21:25.890
That enemy was merely a corpse that 
had been animated using secret arts.

21:25.890 --> 21:29.990
It cannot have been the previous 
Sword Saint—my grandmother.

21:31.560 --> 21:33.450
Then... Then...

21:33.760 --> 21:35.880
What was that last part all about?!

21:35.880 --> 21:38.290
When she was glaring 
reproachfully at you and me?!

21:38.290 --> 21:41.120
If that wasn't my mother... 
If that wasn't Mom—

21:41.120 --> 21:43.000
Stop it, Heinkel.

21:44.880 --> 21:46.240
Stop?

21:47.340 --> 21:48.090
Dad...

21:49.010 --> 21:51.100
Are you saying you're fine with this? He—

21:51.100 --> 21:52.050
Stop.

21:53.670 --> 21:57.220
Stop, Heinkel. Stop.

22:04.230 --> 22:04.900
Stay back!

22:07.740 --> 22:09.330
Reinhard.

22:09.330 --> 22:10.110
Yes.

22:11.150 --> 22:15.670
Do you regret killing your grandmother—

22:16.930 --> 22:18.560
killing Theresia?

22:21.130 --> 22:24.450
No. I did what was right.

22:25.430 --> 22:27.670
I would never regret that.

22:28.920 --> 22:30.100
Indeed.

22:31.760 --> 22:33.280
That is right.

22:36.030 --> 22:40.140
You are right. And I am wrong.

22:41.070 --> 22:44.390
So I have nothing more to say to you.

22:44.800 --> 22:50.480
Your strength will surely be 
needed elsewhere in this battle.

22:51.460 --> 22:55.090
Please, Sword Saint Reinhard-dono...

23:01.990 --> 23:03.790
Dad! You can't go alone!

23:04.250 --> 23:06.380
You need not worry about me.

23:06.990 --> 23:10.050
You only need to think about your own safety.

23:11.410 --> 23:12.780
That is enough.

23:13.210 --> 23:15.190
What... the hell?

23:15.190 --> 23:16.130
What the hell?

23:16.470 --> 23:17.710
What the hell?!

23:17.710 --> 23:19.850
What?! What?! Damn it!

23:20.310 --> 23:21.810
What the hell?!

23:22.130 --> 23:25.020
Damn it! Damn it! Damn it! Damn it!

23:25.290 --> 23:26.640
All of you...

23:31.550 --> 23:34.490
All of you ought to just die!

23:34.490 --> 23:37.480
Just die!
